Hi all,

	If you've used Toan/Dan's program "bar" to make xmgr plots
from BOSS average files, you might be interested in a new version,
also called "bar". It's modified to read MCPRO average files as well.

Usage : bar avgfile [-b]oss [-mc]pro

ie, bar filename.avg -mc 
to generate MCPRO energy distribution and dihedral angle plots

The default filetype is a BOSS average file.

